{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "69970931954694d612ea22eec77579b0ae55ce5c0d67ebe94eda84814df72141", "ja": "わかりあうために", "zh": "为了互相理解", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "29b70cae83aa0f68c345b90858db6d233f8949a0b658753d2d07d24fa6eaae81", "ja": "貴音は自分がメンバーの調和を測ろうと考え\nていたが、ロコの言葉と心が理解できずに\n悩んでいた。噛み合わない貴音とロコ。\nしかし可憐の助言もあり、ふたりはわかり\n合えるようになった。…呼び名以外は。", "zh": "虽然贵音想要担任团员之间的协调角色，\n却因为无法理解ROCO的言语和想法而烦恼。\n对话无法交集的贵音与ROCO，在透过可怜\n的帮助后，让两人开始能够理解彼此。\n……除了称呼以外。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8e31e5611318338fd312f64f9dc5dd65b8ce739022e9f9ad8b6a5a99dc4aec15", "ja": "貴音。相談って何だ？", "zh": "贵音，你想商量什么事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1001_008tak", "source_sha256": "d62ebac05cfe150231f7f5c0a009d9c627f7f6d721b194e201df884c1f2648c5", "ja": "はい……。ARRIVEの在り方について、\n私の意見を申し上げてもよろしいでしょうか。", "zh": "是的……关于ARRIVE的现况，\n小女子能提出自己的意见吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "292675c0d5602361b2c01adc1b70b8afa86ae21a42f15d88b3860cf8eac06a46", "ja": "もちろん！　ユニットを良くするためにも、\n気づいたことはどんどん言ってほしいな。", "zh": "当然可以！这也是为了团体好，\n希望你们有任何发现都能尽量提出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1003_008tak", "source_sha256": "9192391cec01074567d9e52a811c19452ca16f6cbe030d8684ad24a2a7e643ae", "ja": "では、遠慮なく……。\n実は私、篠宮可憐を心配しております。", "zh": "那就直说了……\n其实小女子在担心筿宫可怜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1004_p", "source_sha256": "ff7f00b9351b00c1f7b9e84c2dede98881a5db80a3083928c0b8738233f9be15", "ja": "可憐を？", "zh": "担心可怜？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1005_008tak", "source_sha256": "b88634ef8dc70a11cb1dc29286916e80754a9ba6797b881a6651c4b9c9058c03", "ja": "はい……。\n可憐は、実力こそありますが、繊細です。", "zh": "是的……\n可怜相当有实力，但心思非常细腻。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1006_008tak", "source_sha256": "34db524fc7974a7a42a5e5f5837449f75a1f23db79336b7b499351c461c71fad", "ja": "リーダーとしての心労がかかりすぎないよう……\n私なりに、皆を支えていけたらと。", "zh": "为了避免她因为队长身份而操心过度……\n小女子希望能尽力扶持大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c6056fb70c8f59f5aba0b9e85c78faafbc47a3b0c7d51fc168ac55d395349dfd", "ja": "なるほど……。貴音は貴音の立場で、\nユニットのことを考えてくれたんだな。ありがとう。", "zh": "原来如此……贵音你以自己的立场，\n思考了如何让团体更好呢，谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1008_008tak", "source_sha256": "b8a256595c193d53ae5260c50357d7f694af4422e1775c91480c7cbf2d9ab0c7", "ja": "いえ、このくらいは当然のことです。\n私達は皆、765プロの仲間なのですから。", "zh": "不，这只是理所当然的事，\n因为各位都是765艺能的伙伴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1009_008tak", "source_sha256": "e54a60a41838e881036b056c32d0f872554ec79b1bc397aba05a625f8863c0ef", "ja": "そこで、考えてみたのですが……やはりユニットの\n成功には、皆の結束を固めることが大事かと。", "zh": "小女子思考过了……想让团体成功，\n最重要的还是加强大家的团结意识。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1010_008tak", "source_sha256": "1b91c44a924780476e5665310d3fb60cd7f966d944a8ba78f93dc1400e00ce08", "ja": "己を知り、仲間を知り、互いに助け高め合う……。\n和の心こそが重要ではないかと思うのです。", "zh": "了解自身，了解伙伴，互相帮助，切磋成长……\n小女子认为以和为贵才是关键。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1011_p", "source_sha256": "92ec167ef1eb3f68f918f491f0170059b66589817ab6afa12c67c99fe4a0ff20", "ja": "そうだな。\nメンバー同士の信頼関係は、何よりも大事だ。", "zh": "是啊。\n成员之间互相信赖，比什么都来得重要。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1012_008tak", "source_sha256": "3347a9f15fca1e3965df2c58ef0fa970cb42f74dcb956a46d19b9a2e3631dccc", "ja": "ただ、そのように心がける上で……\n少々困ったことがありまして。", "zh": "但留意到这一点之后……\n小女子为一件事而感到有些烦恼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1013_p", "source_sha256": "20be5cea050e378d42dac46c0e26e86ccc2df8669b3543b312c1d80d0facc403", "ja": "困ったこと？", "zh": "烦恼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1014_008tak", "source_sha256": "e08581ad6110713f9c14d3daa665f39179fbb4744013825f059f10bf4cf55c0b", "ja": "はい……。実は、私……。", "zh": "是的……其实小女子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1015_008tak", "source_sha256": "8c90ae2b40e0e8788f730157d96cf0d61e520cd1d1ddd4651b67dde82d25046a", "ja": "伴田路子が口にする言葉が、\n理解できないのです。", "zh": "无法理解伴田路子说出的话语。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1017_p", "source_sha256": "73ded9a3917aeb5a4d2867f583ac5fce1042089e7d666496309c5e186944bfd7", "ja": "うん、なるほど。", "zh": "嗯，原来是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1018_008tak", "source_sha256": "0b29bffd73c9ce8d260327e16330fab4671bb2b540bfdb8f81d4eb7c58ee080c", "ja": "あのように異国の言葉を散りばめられては、ちんぷん\nかんぷんで……私には、彼女の心が見えないのです。", "zh": "像那样在话中掺入异国的言语，令人完全无法理解。\n……小女子读不懂她心中的思绪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1019_008tak", "source_sha256": "ce452e4553778bbf3c6610cd898848f22c0333d948d4d048163b2755295e5fbf", "ja": "{$P$}、私は、\nどうすればよろしいのでしょうか？", "zh": "{$P$}，请问小女子\n该怎么做才好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1020_p", "source_sha256": "25f229f67bfc68bd0d9b733b793c15bac9d284ce5aba1df5443aaf05d2ae6f6b", "ja": "難しい問題だな……。あれは異国の言葉というより、\nインスピレーションを口にしているというか……。", "zh": "真是个难题呢……与其说那是异国的语言，\n大概只是把Inspiration说出口而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1021_008tak", "source_sha256": "e6d26e7b7ed8f03e324f2d7248f84420419a4826866764e9f5c37914dcf11a4d", "ja": "いんすぴれーしょん……？\nというと……？", "zh": "音司琵擂匈……？\n那是指……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1022_p", "source_sha256": "a8f8dad3aa56b8069b23f6aaaa69894298059567385fff4ea38ac5bb42ca798e", "ja": "まあ、ピンとこないか。\n……よし！", "zh": "没办法，这样没概念呢。\n……好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1023_p", "source_sha256": "416dbb7c6b0fab3b53a89dbc2b16b0c1f7c2ca4a5cc6fddc01c794e60db37624", "ja": "貴音、今からロコのところに行こう！\nまずはロコとの会話に慣れるところから始めるんだ。", "zh": "贵音，我们现在就去找ROCO吧！\n首先要从习惯和ROCO对话开始。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1024_008tak", "source_sha256": "495986fb88846ceed748c0bc06cc509ff9d7914b2fb35871e4fdff6cce73e6a1", "ja": "なるほど……やはり、何事も経験なのですね。\nでは、参りましょう。", "zh": "原来如此……凡事果然都靠经验呀。\n那么，一同前往吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1025_045kar", "source_sha256": "c745ca56c6e0d9ae52aa18a70e006666f0cc544d9f383b0aeee644f2d6ce3db4", "ja": "あれ……{$P$}さんに、\n貴音さんも……ど、どうかしたんですか……？", "zh": "咦……{$P$}先生，\n还有贵音……发、发生什么事了吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1026_p", "source_sha256": "608210b4d787868f38024fa5dacac44db588e9da41b1d681f52fa872c459b542", "ja": "レッスンの途中にすまないな、ふたりとも。\nちょっと、ロコに用事があるんだ。", "zh": "抱歉在训练中途打扰两位，\n我们有事想找一下ROCO。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1027_025roc", "source_sha256": "b40b6588be3ba8517695ff1f49d24668f418ca313ac9acd0ec853f709df1255e", "ja": "ミーティングですか？\nロコはいつでも、プリパレーションできてますよ♪", "zh": "要Meeting吗？\nROCO随时随地都有做好Preparation喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1028_008tak", "source_sha256": "54d42af824a3a36fd6ebe3f436f396c1f25709fbf0846dea5b410854997d5a9c", "ja": "ぷりばれ……。いえ、今は置いておきましょう。\n私は、伴田路子のことをよく知りたいのです。", "zh": "扑礼拔蕾……不，现在先别管了。\n小女子想要深入了解伴田路子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1029_025roc", "source_sha256": "0c965d8f2889ef08f8420d29a186b3012b057574fe137a91430c55318752761c", "ja": "えっ？　た、タカネがロコのことをですか？", "zh": "咦？贵、贵音想要了解ROCO吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1030_008tak", "source_sha256": "1fd7a8605041bb2dfea7f2fe2b96fc09d08884828cb48ef67f612d723cc37a35", "ja": "はい。しかし、なかなか難しく……\n可能な範囲で構いません、教えていただけますか？", "zh": "是的，但是实在有些困难……\n能否于可能的范围内教导小女子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1031_025roc", "source_sha256": "020e7f35555c4070eba36c436cf363e14b45797ebd80dab9a6ed86e9a7535b04", "ja": "なるほど……ロコアートが、タカネのハートを\nキャッチしてしまったんですね！　わかります！", "zh": "原来如此……Rocoart把贵音的Heart\n给Catch住了对吧！ROCO明白了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1032_025roc", "source_sha256": "dad92e48b964119fef6f3845c27cdb79707b6bc62e05b148ff5f726b49392586", "ja": "じゃあまずは、このスケッチブックにアテンション\nしてください！　ロコアートのエッセンスが……。", "zh": "那么首先，请把Attention放在这本\nSketchbook上！Rocoart的Essence就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1033_008tak", "source_sha256": "41fc8a2a926122763477a06bcc2d5ea1ff2700baf4f53a173cf9b9089569e66d", "ja": "ろ、ろこあーと……ではなく、\n私は、伴田路子自身のことが知りたいのですが……。", "zh": "不、不是Rocoart……\n小女子想要了解的，是关于伴田路子本人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1034_025roc", "source_sha256": "0b8d92c10c20ef74be47def3e8ad560ae50550a4cf76d250dcd315f703ccda8c", "ja": "えっ？　……タカネ、ロコアートの\nイノベーティブにシンパシーを感じたんじゃ……？", "zh": "咦……贵音不是对Rocoart的\nInnovative感受到了Sympathy……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1035_008tak", "source_sha256": "f0b1b1b94aae1ec2065f506f7511429b8c14325c1317debd2a106df9cd2d17fe", "ja": "そ、そうですね。私はろこあーとの、\n井野辺支部？とやらを心配したわけではなく……。", "zh": "是、是的，小女子在意的并不是\nRocoart的伊诺北堤湖？之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1036_025roc", "source_sha256": "a6af8c7374c7116461949a03e5a9e38cd2548e2a2821495b4d9ee29e06472ddd", "ja": "……？　{$P$}。タカネの言ってる\nことが、ロコにはちっともわかりません……。", "zh": "……？{$P$}，\nROCO一点都不明白贵音在说什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1037_045kar", "source_sha256": "9fdc3895045da7dc12deaa8800a0c2c34fe18f5c0bd7cf5e147c2308af33004d", "ja": "あ、あの……ロコちゃん。貴音さんは、ロコちゃんの\n友達になりたい……って言ってるんだと思います。", "zh": "那、那个……ROCO，我想贵音的意思是……\n她想要和ROCO做朋友。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1038_045kar", "source_sha256": "01094733d4308c5a1c1e05d1b052dbf7f8b92bc29bf1a8e851d1ef68a0113210", "ja": "こ、これから一緒に頑張る、仲間ですから……。\nきっと、仲良くしたいんじゃないかな……？", "zh": "因、因为是未来要一起努力的伙伴……\n她一定希望和大家变得更要好吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1039_025roc", "source_sha256": "e3c8eebc3fa0032fb54c4b3e461d2b61bc73a0e5acf060c3a7683aa7c0996aca", "ja": "……！　そ、そうだったんですか。\nそうならそうと言ってください、タカネ！", "zh": "……！原、原来是这样啊，\n如果是这样就请直说呀，贵音！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1040_008tak", "source_sha256": "df651c8bdd953b4f5156bf51caf0ca42a1c6ecaa0a435b29f46906217801977b", "ja": "なんと……通訳をもこなすとは……\nありがたいことです。", "zh": "竟然……还能够协助翻译……\n真是令人感激。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1041_045kar", "source_sha256": "0c63866f71e0850862a4f1c4e185fa53f8a1714fd456ba82431024e7ca61674b", "ja": "そ、そんな、大したことでは……\nでも、あってたみたいで、よかった……♪", "zh": "不、不是那么了不起的事……\n但似乎有猜对，真是太好了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1042_025roc", "source_sha256": "e6219362941b161796aff6e39606200edab76fac76822cedc8c0954708c8a077", "ja": "えへへ……でも、タカネ！　それならますます、\nロコアートについて知ってほしいです！", "zh": "嘿嘿……但是啊，贵音！这样的话\nROCO就更希望你能了解Rocoart了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1043_025roc", "source_sha256": "f1b3c15174c253fdd5bd45897b42282d20250d4722ab6ff797779fce82ba7a89", "ja": "ロコ＝ロコアートですから！\nさ、これをオブザーブしてください！", "zh": "因为ROCO＝Rocoart！\n来，请Observe这个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1044_008tak", "source_sha256": "8ffd216cb0de406f5c05c0fca2465c9fed1e53e6f0e3f24e7e9d880bafe0350a", "ja": "おぶさーる……はっ！　この面妖な曲線と色遣い……\n真、趣深い芸術作品です。これが、ろこあーと……。", "zh": "欧布萨鲁……啊！这甚奇的曲线及用色……\n着实是件奥妙的艺术作品。这就是Rocoart……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1045_025roc", "source_sha256": "479d960c5f97eda737604c948d7aba2fea71c8b0dc2917cf131f2c459e75aef9", "ja": "そうなんです！\n我ながら、これはマーベラスな出来だと想います！", "zh": "正是这样！\n连ROCO自己都觉得非常Marvelous！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1046_008tak", "source_sha256": "36d3d2bfdf84c0d9a75e0263cd2388e4e499b6106ceb93e5c7a8cb012cd79fe5", "ja": "ふふ……たしかに伴田路子を理解する上で、\nこの絵画を拝見するのは効果的でした。", "zh": "呵呵……拜见这幅画作，\n对于理解伴田路子的确相当有帮助。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1047_025roc", "source_sha256": "66b7a24dafcc92b6ef237d086a7c62ed80d3a05087a3a7fd85aa1698e4fd4cd2", "ja": "ロコアートの魅力をシェアできてうれしいです！\nタカネはまさにベストフレンドです♪", "zh": "很高兴能Share关于Rocoart的魅力！\n贵音简直就是Best friend♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1048_045kar", "source_sha256": "52d9e17777ee02885bd973d81e5027f5ae075ab8b46d3edfe06f771baa09ee03", "ja": "貴音さん、ロコちゃん……。\nな、仲良くなれそうですね……よかった……。", "zh": "贵音、ROCO……\n看、看来她们能好好相处呢……太好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1049_p", "source_sha256": "cf93b62aa680df7314b9941f04e3b37f5f799891d7b7c6f5a11110fa90b38836", "ja": "可憐のおかげだよ。\n可憐が貴音の気持ちを、翻訳してくれたからこそだ。", "zh": "这都是多亏了可怜喔，\n因为你帮贵音翻译了她的想法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1050_045kar", "source_sha256": "d1f9744d3384d2c4b769f12e8029d3fdfbc5aef75bcc9f7dd87ba6fd20074f05", "ja": "そ、そんな……。私は、貴音さんの気持ちが\n伝わればいいなって……ただ、それだけで。", "zh": "怎、怎么这么说……我只是希望贵音的想法\n能够传达出去……只是这样而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1051_p", "source_sha256": "5759e47bbe010c76d3961cab5b97970d01376a96d81b0e982d25552fd62beb01", "ja": "それだけでいいんだよ。可憐がした方がいいと思う\nことを、自信を持ってしていけばいい。", "zh": "这样就足够了啊，可怜要对自己认为该做的事\n抱持多一点信心才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1052_p", "source_sha256": "ff8a444b14a50280930e535e9e7f7e64f4d5644cf1aa7cf65c63a571c4181ab7", "ja": "メンバーのことを見て、メンバーの手助けをする。\nそれは立派なリーダーの仕事だからな。", "zh": "因为观察成员并给予协助，\n正是队长的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1053_045kar", "source_sha256": "a44b27c7fb956ed2a1fe423a5d08250d37d3c19f77018151fe63b83a7e17a08c", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\nあ、ありがとうございます……！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n谢、谢谢你……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1054_008tak", "source_sha256": "82ec46dc6e2904ed139fc17b75bd072d0442cfb7daa930a56739a91b7a6b68ed", "ja": "伴田路子……いえ。今こそ親愛の気持ちを込めて、\nこう呼ばせてください。", "zh": "伴田路子……不，现在请让小女子\n抱着亲爱之情如此呼唤你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1055_008tak", "source_sha256": "bae4f2af86953e73f567305d22846a93b2745d74859f807d960fa70a777b8fd9", "ja": "「みちこ」。", "zh": "「路子（MICHICO）」。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_02_1056_025roc", "source_sha256": "aea86658364432535e5053cfd46b5eabd82475cb9fe1a83c160f37de2fac474f", "ja": "み、みちこじゃないです！\nロコのファーストネームは、ロコなんですってばー！", "zh": "不、不是MICHICO啦！\n就说ROCO的First name是念作ROCO嘛──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
